            },
            {
              "type": "Text",
              "content": "For more than six decades, Nissan Patrol has built its reputation across Australia’s toughest terrain, with more than 258,000 vehicles sold locally since 1961, becoming one of Australia’s most enduring automotive icons.",
              "style": {
                "color": "#ece5d5",
                "fontSize": "16px",
                "fontWeight": 400,
                "textAlign": "center",
                "fontFamily": "\"Verdana\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif",
                "margin": 0,
                "marginBottom": 18,
                "padding": 0,
                "lineHeight": "26px"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "Text",
              "content": "Today, we celebrate the final V8-powered Y62 Patrol. As the last Patrol equipped with Nissan’s iconic 5.6-litre petrol V8, delivering 298kW and 560Nm, it combines an exceptional towing capacity and proven off-road performance with the unmistakable character of a V8.",
              "style": {
                "color": "#ece5d5",
                "fontSize": "16px",
                "fontWeight": 400,
                "textAlign": "center",
                "fontFamily": "\"Verdana\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif",
                "margin": 0,
                "marginBottom": 18,
                "padding": 0,
                "lineHeight": "26px"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "Text",
              "content": "Don't miss your final opportunity to own the last of the V8 Patrol.",
              "style": {
                "color": "#ece5d5",
                "fontSize": "16px",
                "fontWeight": 400,
                "textAlign": "center",
